- **The scorecard sets conviction 2.** The total is 3, made up of:
  - quality 0 (ROIC TTM 8.8%)
  - quality direction 1
  - balance sheet 0 (net debt/EBITDA 3.68x)
  - valuation 2 (upside +9%, because the unreliable fair value is ignored)
  - moat 1
  - key risk −1

