The file is written and complete apart from that error. The decision is AVOID at conviction 2, with no entry price because a lower price wouldn't fix the quality problem, and four business triggers that would make me look again. To clear the block you could do one of two things:
1. Have the consistency check accept a scorecard-only conviction change when the decision (AVOID) stays the same.
2. Accept the earlier AVOID 3, which the scorecard check would then reject instead.

